    "historical": "EXP-20261017-016, one PS4 Slim Baikal B1, Orbis 12.02, private 6.18.44-ps4-baikal-mts2; DEGRADED overall",
    "this_target": "6.18.44-psx-ps4-baikal2 CI builds have not been booted. Their ordered patch set equals local build 6.18.44-psx-ps4-baikal-native-dev1 (OrbStack, Debian GCC 14.2; bzImage e92565bcfec82d0739f44bace1fa779d561d9e60497fb0ba815e7c40b016ee3c), whose config differed only in CONFIG_LOCALVERSION. That build passed EXP-20261017-019 (cable at launch, one unplug/replug, operation beyond 900 s) and EXP-20261017-020 (no cable at launch, then plugged) on one Baikal console with no Ethernet adapter. The owner set the Ethernet promotion count at those two boots. Not acceptance.",
    "previous_release": "6.18.44-psx-ps4-baikal1 (CI builds up to 28e6aae; no published release) booted once in EXP-20261017-018 with display, Wi-Fi and Bluetooth; an Aeolia xHCI death later in that boot left its stability DEGRADED.",
