      "path": "platforms/ps4/patches/6.18-baikal-mts2/0700-network-mts/0002-net-ps4-mts-native-autoload.patch",
      "sha256": "e6e799c9d82618f1c92abfaa801cb49613feb4d4f4f033bdd79e5d5f3a0ee9b3",
      "subject": "net: ps4: native psx_mts_net autoload and self-arming open",
      "author": "Linux psX contributors",
      "license": "GPL-2.0-only, as the MTS2 driver it changes",
      "note": "Exports the 104d:90d8 PCI ID so udev loads psx_mts_net, lets the first open publish without an allow_open write (autoarm, default 1) and registers psx0 from the module LIVE notifier. The one-retained-DMA-generation contract and the probe, fresh-baseline and first-open checks are unchanged."
